     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi there,</div><div><br></div><div>My name is Pita.</div><div>I am trying to create Latent Profiles from three variables using tidyLPA package in R I followed the instructions on <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496053235000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0o0c4XlZDxUZ-ikUIuNShD\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>Here is the code line I used, the intention is to create 5 latent profiles.</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">SUBGROUP&lt;-cbind(CLASTA$PERSONAL, CLASTA$NEUTRAL, CLASTA$MARKETER)</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">MCLUST_PROFILES&lt;-SUBGROUP[,1:3]%&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  select(PERSONAL, NEUTRAL, MARKETER)%&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  single_imputation()%&gt;% estimate_profiles(5)</font></div><div><br></div><div>However, I kept on getting an error message </div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">&gt; MCLUST_PROFILES&lt;-SUBGROUP[,1:3]%&gt;% </font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">+   select(PERSONAL, NEUTRAL, MARKETER)%&gt;%</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">+   single_imputation()%&gt;% estimate_profiles(5)</font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">Error in UseMethod(&quot;select_&quot;) : </font></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  no applicable method for &#39;select_&#39; applied to an object of class &quot;c(&#39;matrix&#39;, &#39;double&#39;, &#39;numeric&#39;)&quot;</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>I would be very appreciative if you could offer a piece of advice on this as well as a code line for MplusAutomation since I have it installed on my computer. I would also like to compare three solutions 3, 4, and 5 latent profiles.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for your time.</div></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>--------------</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Peter J. MKUMBO, Ph.D.</i></font></b></div><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i>Department of Parks, Recreation &amp; Tourism Management</i></font></b><br></div><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Clemson University</i></font></b></div><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">270 Lehotsky Hall</i></font></b></div><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Clemson, SC, 29634-0735</i></font></b></div><div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pmk...@g.clemson.edu</a></i></font></b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
