    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi Pita, thank you for your message, wondering if this is an issue with select. It&#39;s (in)famous for namespace conflicts (cases in which\r\n<i>another </i>select function, rather than the one from dplyr you intended to use, is used).</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Can you try to replace select() with dplyr::select()?</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Josh</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<a name=\"m_-3131582886839830645__MailAutoSig\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Times\">-- <br>\r\n</span></a><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa/attach/ad9e0faff651e/Outlook-wyms4ofg.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Helvetica;colo