    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Apr 16, 2019 at 3:43 PM Rosenberg, Joshua &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jmros...@utk.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi Pita, thank you for your message, wondering if this is an issue with select. It&#39;s (in)famous for namespace conflicts (cases in which\r\n<i>another </i>select function, rather than the one from dplyr you intended to use, is used).</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Can you try to replace select() with dplyr::select()?</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Josh</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<a name=\"m_-2888186935031961261_m_7531031437776928011__MailAutoSig\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Times\">-- <br>\r\n</span></a><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa/attach/ad9fe4a0f1d22/Outlook-wyms4ofg.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\"><a href=\"https://joshuamrosenberg.com/\" title=\"https://joshuamrosenberg.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://joshuamrosenberg.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496053240000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12EjJ98rPUww2GbBVfXBIq\">Joshua M. Rosenberg</a></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\">Assistant Professor, STEM Education</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\">The University of Tennessee, Knoxville</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\">Dept. of Theory and Practice in Teacher Education\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\">420 Claxton</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\">, 1122 Volunteer Boulevard, Knoxville, TN 37996</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\"><a href title=\"mailto:jmr...@utk.edu\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jmros...@utk.edu</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:rgb(88,89,91)\"><a href=\"tel:(865)%20974-5973\" value=\"+18659745973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(865) 974-5973</a><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tid...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tid...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Peter MKUMBO &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pmk...@g.clemson.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, April 4, 2019 11:51 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tid...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> tidyLPA</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>Hi there,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>My name is Pita.</div>\r\n<div>I am trying to create Latent Profiles from three variables using tidyLPA package in R I followed the instructions on <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496053240000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1kSGDvDg_vDAm9cqy8UYZr\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tidyLPA/vignettes/Introduction_to_tidyLPA.html</a></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Here is the code line I used, the intention is to create 5 latent profiles.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">SUBGROUP&lt;-cbind(CLASTA$PERSONAL, CLASTA$NEUTRAL, CLASTA$MARKETER)</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">MCLUST_PROFILES&lt;-SUBGROUP[,1:3]%&gt;% </font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  select(PERSONAL, NEUTRAL, MARKETER)%&gt;%</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  single_imputation()%&gt;% estimate_profiles(5)</font></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>However, I kept on getting an error message </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">&gt; MCLUST_PROFILES&lt;-SUBGROUP[,1:3]%&gt;% </font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">+   select(PERSONAL, NEUTRAL, MARKETER)%&gt;%</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">+   single_imputation()%&gt;% estimate_profiles(5)</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">Error in UseMethod(&quot;select_&quot;) : </font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">  no applicable method for &#39;select_&#39; applied to an object of class &quot;c(&#39;matrix&#39;, &#39;double&#39;, &#39;numeric&#39;)&quot;</font></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I would be very appreciative if you could offer a piece of advice on this as well as a code line for MplusAutomation since I have it installed on my computer. I would also like to compare three solutions 3, 4, and 5 latent profiles.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thank you so much for your time.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>--------------</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Peter J. MKUMBO, Ph.D.</i></font></b></div>\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i>Department of Parks, Recreation &amp; Tourism Management</i></font></b><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Clemson University</i></font></b></div>\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">270 Lehotsky Hall</i></font></b></div>\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Clemson, SC, 29634-0735</i></font></b></div>\r\n<div><b><font size=\"1\" color=\"#38761d\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">pmk...@g.clemson.edu</a></i></font></b></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;tidyLPA&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tidylpa+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tid...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496053240000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yeRM9byQ0Unim-0guO2wI\">https://groups.google.com/group/tidylpa</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/tidylpa/CAELjyxq11m8Rt0Pfnk5TM%3DkC75cx9gJ9CxiU_VaZjDfYrAMhHQ%40mail.gmail.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/tidylpa/CAELjyxq11m8Rt0Pfnk5TM%253DkC75cx9gJ9CxiU_VaZjDfYrAMhHQ%2540mail.gmail.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;